        <h2>About Smart Services Hub</h2>
        <p>Smart Services Hub focuses on practical, efficient solutions: Linux‑powered automation, clean web builds, and AI‑driven tools that actually get used. No fluff, no over‑engineering — just systems that work.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <h2>How I Work</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-3">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Linux‑First Mindset</h3>
                <p>Everything is built with stability and automation in mind, using Linux as the backbone for reliability and control.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Modular & Reusable</h3>
                <p>Sites and systems are built in a way that makes them easy to extend, duplicate, and adapt for future projects.</p>
